<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">2 Thessalonica</book>
  <para style="h">2 Thessalonica</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Thessalonica</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Thessalonica</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Thessalonica</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Silvanus le Timothy-te in, i Pa Pasien le Topa Jesu Khris sunga a om Thessalonica khuo hlattuom pawlpite tungah lai kang hlah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I Pa Pasien le Topa Jesu Khris tung pan hepina le lungnopna in note tungah ang tung taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, na upna uh nahpi tahin khangin khatlekhat na ki-itna uh zong khang semsem ahi ziehin, note adingin Pasien tungah lungdam ka ko zing ding uh a kilawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin note in na thuoh uh bawlsietna le gimna zosie-ah thuohzawhna le upna nei na hi ziehun komate ma zong Pasien’ hlattuom pawlpite lahah ka na kisiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami thute in Pasien’ manggam tawh a kilawm dinga note ang kibawl sawmna ahi a dih Pasien’ thukhenna kilangsah a, note in zong tua thute zieha na thuoh uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note ang gentheisah mite tungah Pasien in gentheina ma tawh thuhkia valon ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa Jesu in vantung panin a thahat a vantung mite tawh ang kilat ciengin gimna a thuoh note le kote tungah zong tawldamna ei piehton ding pen a thuman hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasien a thei lo mite le i Topa Jesu’ lungdamna thu a mang lo mite, meikuong sungah phulahna tawh a thuhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa opna pan le a thupi ama’ vanglietna panin tam mite kikhenkhie-in tawntung sietna dan a thuoh ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a misiengthote ziehin minthanna nga dingin ang pei ciengin note kunga ka teci pan uh a ki-up ziehin tua ni ciengin ama a umsa mi zosiete lahah lamdang kisa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam thu a tangtun nadingin i Pasien in ama’ hlatna tawh kituohin hing siemin, a vanglietna tawh na lunggulna hoi zosie ule upna nasep hoite ang kicinsah thei nadingin note adingin thu ka ngen zing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n i Pasien le i Topa Jesu Khris’ hepina tawh kizui-in note sungah i Topa Jesu minthangin, ama sungah note na minthan thei nading uh thu ngen zing ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, i Topa Jesu Khris ang peikia ding vai le ama kungah eite i kikaituo nading vai tawh kisai-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa’ ni ang tung ta hi, ci-in hlagau zieh ahiei, thu kigensawn zieh ahiei, ahi sihle ko kung pana ang pei dan a kibawltawm laihahte ziehin ahiei, lunghimaw-in na patau pai lo nadingun na tung vuah kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lam khat popo-ah koima in kisolsah sih un; azieh pen ledona ang tung masa-in, manthaina thuoh dinga laitansa ahi thukham palsat pa ang kilah masangsie-in tua ni ang tung sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in pasien a kici zosie le a kibie zosie langpangin ama le ama kitawisang ding a, tuaci’n Pasien’ biehinnpi sungah ama to-in Pasien ka hi hi, ci-in ama le ama kipulah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note tawh kang opton lai-in na kung vuah tam thute kang gen na phawh nawn sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hun ang tun ciengin ama ang kilah thei nadingin, bang in ama kham ahei, ci thu na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tua thukham palsatna thuthuh in na sem zo a, ahi vangin tu-a ama a khamcip pa a kihep masangsie-in ama in khamcip lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin thukham palsat pa ang kilang ding a, Topa Jesu in a kam panin ama’ huu tawh ama susie ding a, ama ang peina zieha a kilahna tawh ama sumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vanglietna zosie, limte, le a lamdang solnate a zang Satan’ nasepna sungah thukham palsat pa ang pei ahi lamtah kilang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a kisie ding mite in hutdam hi thei nadingin thuman thutah pom ding a nuol ziehun solna namkim a thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam thu ziehin amate in zuouthu a up nadingun Pasien in amate tungah solna lienpi tungsah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tua thuman thutah um loin, thuman lona sungah nuom a sa mite zosie tungah mawsah thukhenna a tun thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa’ ang it sanggamte aw, Hlagau kisiensuona tungtawn le thuman thutah na upna uh tungtawnin hutdamna nga nadinga ga masa dingin Pasien in note ang teel ziehin, note adingin Pasien kungah lungdam ka ko zing ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tami ngimna ziehin note in Topa Jesu Khris’ minthanna na nga thei nadingun ama in ka tangko uh lungdamna thu tha tungtawnin note ang hlan zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin sanggamte aw, note in kam tawh hile, lai tawh hile kang hilsa uh ngainate pomdetin kiptahin ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu-in i Topa Jesu Khris mama le eite ei it a, kumtawn henepna le hepina tungtawnin lametna hoi ei pie pa i pa uh Pasien in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />na lungsimte uh hing henem hinlen, thu hoi le nasep hoi namcin-ah hing thakhausah taheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, a nukhia penin note lahah a piengsa bang tehtehin mun zosie-ah Topa’ thu a mallangin kizelin a kithan thei nading le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />mi hoilote le mi gilote kung panin ka suotah thei nadingun thu ei na ngetpieh un; bangzieh ahei cile mi zosie in upna a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa a muonhuoi a, note hing thahat sahin gilopa kung panin ang kem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note in kang thupiehte uh na zui vua, Topa sungah a zui suoh lai dingin zong kang muong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasien’ itna le Khris’ thuohzawhna lamah na lungsim uh Topa in lam hing lah taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in kang itte aw, kote tung panin amate in a sansa uh ngainate tawh kituoh loin nasep a thada thu umte na pelh nadingun i Topa Jesu Khris’ minin thu kang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kote nei ette ding vua kilawm ahi lam no mama in na theisa uh ahi hi; note tawh ka opton sungun ka thasie sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a man pie loin koima’ an ka mawh neh sih uhi; mi khatpo’ vangih ka suo lo nadingun gimpipi-in sun le zanin na ka semzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua bang neh theina ding thu a nei lo ka hi tuon sih vua, note’ ette ding limpha kang lah nop man uh ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note tawh ka opton lai nangawnun zong nasem nuom lo mi poma in an ne sih heh, ci-in thu kang pie zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note lahah mi pawl khat thasie-in bangma sem loin mi nasepnate-ah kikumthaw-in a op lam uh ka za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in tua bang mite in a anneh ding uh thalaw-in, a na uh a sep khinkhian nadingun kote in Topa Jesu Khris minin thu pie-in ka hanthawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, na hoi sep ding cimtah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tami lai sunga ka thugente uh a mang nuom lote ciemte unlen, a maizum thei nadingun na kigop sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate gal bangin ngaisun sih unlen, thu umte bangin thu hil un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu-in kilemna Topa mama in na vai zosie vuah a tawntungin lungnopna hing pie taheh. Topa in note zosie hing ompi taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima Paul in ka khut mama tawh tami nosetna lai kang giel ahi hi. Ka laihah zosie tam banga ka ciemte ahi a, tami khu ka lai gieldan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Note tawh i Topa Jesu Khris’ hepina hing om taheh.
  </para>
</usx>
